<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35712</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35712</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:29:12 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>消息人士称，普京10月9日与特朗普的电话中提议与特朗普和习近平下月在深圳APEC会议上举行峰会，讨论如何结束乌克兰战争。特朗普并未同意，但可能对此持开放态度。<br/>该峰会没有乌克兰和欧洲国家参与。乌克兰外长批评了该想法，认为这会鼓励普京继续战争。<br/>泽连斯基19日表示，俄罗斯利用导弹和无人机袭击乌克兰能源设施，而且乌克兰再次未收到袭击预警。<br/>（<a href="https://www.wsj.com/world/russia/putin-floats-a-summit-with-trump-and-xi-to-decide-ukraines-fate-1cf6acc1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">华尔街日报</a>，<a href="https://apnews.com/article/russia-ukraine-war-kyiv-attack-b041f78e5d037a0f3377b7108eac1dc7" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/QY_3UIo7sq3o8UX1LcjXvc2J5uos0gtSO-VrUbtrT5E-0RjMXojKQG12vVIrgbvqyh_SO9849ICVjhx0X1lRXGbcy38aBBEQsupMIq9hitqKyIfsrj85mrRnk5mbjMGk-gE70o29rnErXJhpG-pqbmuRCGNZIvPM-fli7BNlecVxk77uJEShxW_YqD3yOgwY0FPREdXO2SpU69D8TygOXyk4W_XTgxHQS-J8ITg1UQQHRu1q2Wl0VOd9JIqYpWlhSN7XayqsFqacJwJmEmtkZEY3zeEwFo6Vv34FGGmiDUF35P1WaSu14AHWagImma5WsIalk1HudhvCZhJ48wSbUA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
