<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35702</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:07:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">法国多地10月17日爆发抗议活动，数万人因物价上涨和公共支出下降走上街头，同时表达对抗议学生的支持。警方与抗议者爆发冲突。<br/>在巴黎，有汽车和报刊亭被纵火，警方使用催泪瓦斯和水炮驱散暴力抗议者。但更多的和平抗议者高唱国歌、挥舞国旗进行游行。在里昂和马赛等地，有政府建筑物被纵火或破坏。<br/>截至下午，已有272人因暴力事件被捕。<br/>（<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/students-trade-unions-yellow-vests-set-protest-across-france-2026-10-17/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透社</a>，<a href="https://apnews.com/article/france-school-protests-yellow-vest-44b9d3ba91ffad4029f975dced7e31cb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/W0IXA6wNycJlHWdqwSYjPt514ngtRiTzVeqhvJ8xKDrp0Iw7_ajlg3JGsVs9PG12jXnOYVd2UvzccC1clYlehGjEO6kIw4bshnvd9cGa-QwPj6nuRZsxdOZFPUb_i0m5lyfM7aPXwUJ-3vYgrE8MPIWtV5AgMUeVdj3LPoq9GTiSQ84hLmmA03tSFvq-Mb7j9cwhxZVutUgTRuO2MdUW9PFERyqPl0lfqiO3wCntI5ENFizmIfsfGNXgX6ZyXKqB-fwOdPRIbT-S6rsuo73ZsMdd6X4bi8qTLdg6OiPMUeDfPYUP3J4ANB7gXh5SXZL8c76fqpOmwmjOW8whsn8cCw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/C2BJKs9NGTjTtl1uXPxFT2nw66QuLSDcuD9fe3MwXSA94Rh_RRYkC5KgUTDeaYDdzwAfhOrlls47oPEBvCATVcPzAM17-tSfs_QakxRy7BUygO87wdvVz9ARXAulBBPJCa_VwdIDaqqO0qwN5VEFTHiYLnIShEwHoAtNxFgUkmEyJh1CcmuiCCv0H1zt_TbpJ8mMkLwTnlPzsiwENSJ2_avRQRsgcwCH-U5_S1BdBkiV71c2LkRR27M9IlQDpbAkMBeqS3k2rQdkbxBimbp12JHCDJfxh65B6pGSSijj5l1caobQnDokg1Q6UAbKHCRArLLhk8IX6BDQqQB9mhjiMA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/a9lUkoqOhjgKlc5GEfLZjEqj8r_1H16T_1ju9AtuZvBXp689sHOX7q6308eoGTJ8Jq8smKsRIozrpEbHc7tST6w9tydW12-zkRvXTDBfQmTBy_t9kfj_A-NVah2c5GjDoRSO1GbG6UWS9jxWqbmtFEvyaZ_aAs0LykeCfQyMJV1pXsIilSe0KsqdhhI6r4jLizPuAXMlOKho3o610tZcQofLgGIOcUFs5Q7kfC9sLRTaFuPdjybbSYLs3cUqgEshL7_JmGI0AclgwJ8zShsskjKfJprQq7H3KwQeEwfE6Vd0ORVEkJdg3-DVzP8sRYP7N_3